{"id":"5a0a940e7dd346c9","group":"73","path":"73/73-ex-zero-l-doubling-noncfl.md","title":"0L 倍增语言并非 CFL","display":"ex-zero-l-doubling-noncfl — 0L 倍增语言并非 CFL","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-ex-zero-l-doubling-noncfl","aliases":["73-ex-zero-l-doubling-noncfl"],"display":"ex-zero-l-doubling-noncfl — 0L 倍增语言并非 CFL","depends_on":["[[73-df-zero-l-system]]","[[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"§14.4, p. 391; local example and pumping proof","source_status":"local-example-with-proof","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§14.4, p. 391; local example and pumping proof","legacy_source_status":"local-example-with-proof","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-ex-zero-l-doubling-noncfl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-ex-zero-l-doubling-noncfl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-zero-l-doubling-noncfl — 0L 倍增语言并非 CFL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e81a88fc44254236\" href=\"?note=e81a88fc44254236\" title=\"73-df-zero-l-system\">73-df-zero-l-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c8c56808857d2df\" href=\"?note=5c8c56808857d2df\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound\">73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§14.4, p. 391; local example and pumping proof"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-example-with-proof"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§14.4, p. 391; local example and pumping proof"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-example-with-proof"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{a\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{a\\}\\)</span> 为单字符字母表。0L 语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e81a88fc44254236\" href=\"?note=e81a88fc44254236\" title=\"73-df-zero-l-system\">73-df-zero-l-system</a>，CFL 泵引理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c8c56808857d2df\" href=\"?note=5c8c56808857d2df\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound\">73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}doubling\\text{-}noncfl}\\vdash\nG_2\\coloneqq(\\Sigma,\\{(a,aa)\\},\\langle a\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}doubling\\text{-}noncfl}\\vdash\nG_2\\coloneqq(\\Sigma,\\{(a,aa)\\},\\langle a\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}doubling\\text{-}noncfl}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G_2)\\land L(G_2)=\\{a^{2^n}:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\land L(G_2)\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}doubling\\text{-}noncfl}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G_2)\\land L(G_2)=\\{a^{2^n}:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\land L(G_2)\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>每轮长度恰加倍。若该语言是 CFL，取足够大的 2ⁿ 大于泵长度 p；两条被泵段的总长度 d 满足 1≤d≤p。泵一次额外副本得到长度 2ⁿ+d，严格位于相邻的 2ⁿ 与 2ⁿ⁺¹ 之间，矛盾。这是依本书并行改写定义给出的本地例子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-zero-l-system","status":"resolved","id":"e81a88fc44254236","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-zero-l-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5c8c56808857d2df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-zero-l-system","status":"resolved","id":"e81a88fc44254236","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a\\}$ 为单字符字母表。0L 语言见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]，CFL 泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5c8c56808857d2df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a\\}$ 为单字符字母表。0L 语言见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]，CFL 泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}doubling\\text{-}noncfl}\\vdash\nG_2\\coloneqq(\\Sigma,\\{(a,aa)\\},\\langle a\\rangle)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}doubling\\text{-}noncfl}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G_2)\\land L(G_2)=\\{a^{2^n}:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\land L(G_2)\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":1830,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-355","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-zero-l-doubling-noncfl|0L 倍增语言并非 CFL]]"}],"outgoing":["e81a88fc44254236","5c8c56808857d2df"]}